"}]},"DescQuillHTML":"<p><div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#000;color:#fff;padding:20px;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-radius:8px"> <h1 style="font-size:24px;color:gold;margin-bottom:10px;text-align:center">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h1> <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden"> <thead> <tr> <th style="padding:12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #555;background-color:#b22222;color:#fff">Question</th> <th style="padding:12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #555;background-color:#b22222;color:#fff">Answer</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">What currency do you accept?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">We only accept AUD (Australian Dollar).</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">How do I create an account?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">Click the "REGISTER" button on the homepage to sign up. Once registered, click "DEPOSIT" to add funds and "WITHDRAW" to cash out.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">Can I register multiple accounts?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">No, creating multiple accounts is strictly prohibited. If this rule is violated, your account will be restricted, and your credits will be forfeited.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">What are the deposit and withdrawal limits?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000"> - Minimum deposit: AUD1<br> - Minimum withdrawal: AUD10 (excluding bonuses)<br> - All deposits require a 1x Rollover (Total Bet).<br> - Daily withdrawal limit x3 time. </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">Can I deposit again if I still have balance?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">To avoid confusion with bonus rules, you must use all your funds first before making another deposit. You can deposit again once your balance is below AUD1 or after withdrawing funds.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">What do Rollover and Turnover mean?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000"> - <b>Rollover:</b> The total amount wagered in games.<br> - <b>Turnover:</b> The final remaining credit required to make a withdrawal. </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">Can I claim multiple bonuses at the same time?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">No, you can only claim one promotion, bonus, rebate, commission, Angpau, etc. Bonuses cannot be combined.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">Why do some game platforms disappear at times?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">For maintenance and system upgrades, some game platforms may be temporarily removed. They will return once maintenance is complete.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">I've completed the rollover requirements. Why am I unable to withdraw?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">If you've completed the rollover requirements, exit the game completely and allow the system time to update your progress. Once the rollover progress bar is full, withdrawals will be available.</td> </tr>&nbsp;</p><p></tr> <tr> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:gold;color:#000;font-weight:bold">What is ban game list？</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">The banned games list means that the games are under maintenance or have problems. So in order to affect the customer's gaming experience, we have this list to prevent customers from entering these games. <a href="https://static.gwvkyk.com/media/2516c60015c86afe9e769.jpg" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(230, 0, 0);"><strong><u>View Sample Here</u></strong></a><a href="https://static.gwvkyk.com/media/71d2ed2e6bb76d04ef4b9.jpg" target="_blank"> </a> </td> </tr></tbody> </table> <p style="text-align:center;color:gold;font-size:18px;margin-top:20px">Thank you for visiting REEF33 AUD FAQ section!</p> </div></p><p><br></p>"}
